        "id": 150181,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-11-10T22:46:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The problem with sidekicks in SotM is that they're hard to do from a game perspective. &nbsp;As a sidekick, they should logically be weaker than the regular heros, but that makes them less desirable as a playable character. &nbsp;If you add them in as a second character card for the hero (like the Sentinels), then you have a card which probably has less health and is less useful the the main hero, and you get a problem like with Spite where it's not stragically sound to try and keep the sidekick alive.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:28:47.558Z",
