        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-11-13T03:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"seesome\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/48/2018_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> seesome:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fanatic needs a sidekick who rides a BMX stunt bike!&nbsp; (Ref: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sbzUfV3_JIA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Angel Summoner &amp; BMX Bandit</a>)Seriously though: I could see Fanatic having a squire-like sidekick who cares for her armor and keeps candles lit in her sanctuary&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I hope that sidekick's beefy, because her armor weighs 100 pounds.</p>",
